nnels. Private bathroom provides a hairdryer, a bathrobe and free toiletries.\n\nThe hotel is situated in the elegant area of the','Nr. 7 Brigada Viii Street Tirane ','Albanien','Albania'),(24,'Hotel Green','Hotel',3,1350.00,'Located in a suburb of Tirana, Hotel Green is just a couple of steps from the national road Tirana-Durres. Surrounded by a garden, the hotel offers an on-site bar and restaurant serving traditional and international dishes.\n\nAll rooms are air-conditioned and feature free Wi-Fi, satellite TV and a private bathroom with shower. Guests can park their car for free on site.\n\nBreakfast is served at the hotel restaurant each day. The front desk is open 24 hours a day and room service is available.\n\nThe','Rruga Kavajes. Kombinat Km 2. Vaqarr VaqarrTirana ','Albanien','Albania'),(25,'Theranda Hotel','Hotel',3,1350.00,'Set in Tirana, 1.2 km from Skanderbeg Square, Theranda Boutique Hotel offers accommodation with a garden, free private parking and a bar. This 3-star hotel offers a concierge service. The accommodation features a 24-hour front desk, airport transfers, room service and free WiFi throughout the property.\n\nGuests at the hotel can enjoy a continental breakfast.\n\nTheranda Boutique Hotel offers a sun terrace.\n\nPopular points of interest near the accommodation include Former Residence of Enver Hoxha, P','Rr. Andon Zako Cajupi Villa 6 & 7 Villa 6 & 7TiranëShqipëri ','Albanien','Albania'),(26,'Seven Hotel','Hotel',3,1350.00,'This hotel enjoys an enviable setting in Tirana. The hotel is situated within easy access of a number of the city\'s most prominent attractions, including the National Bank of Albania, National Museum of History, Skanderbeg Square, the Ministry of Economy, Trade and Energy and the Palace of Culture. Guests are afforded an insight into the rich culture and history of the area. This charming hotel is draped in traditional style, beautifully coupling it with contemporary convenience. The guest rooms','KAVAJA STREET, CL